<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM LOAD FACTOR RISES IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>KLM LOAD FACTOR RISES IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional traffic and load</p>
<p>factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines (millions of</p>
<p>tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			   June '97   June '96 Apr-June 97 Apr-June 96</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			807.1     720.3     2,338.1    2,113.0</p>
<p>Capacity		   1,012.8     945.0     2,998.7    2,870.2</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   79.7	76.2	  78.0	 73.6</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Passenger kilometres   4,761.6   4,112.5    13,663.2   11,726.5</p>
<p>Seat kilometres	  5,855.5   5,333.4    17,310.2   15,980.1</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   81.3	77.1	  78.9	 73.4</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			332.1     310.3	 967.6	937.5</p>
<p>Capacity		     459.1     446.4     1,366.8    1,388.5</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   72.3	69.5	  70.8	 67.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
